{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luvarith</strong> rots on the edge of collapse. The forest whispers with hunger and the kingdom holds more secrets than it ever did kings. And beneath the ruins, something older still waits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2Deco role-playing game about scavengers, traitors, and survivors caught in a web of lies and forgotten history. Wander the blackened ruins of <strong>Vespera\u2019s Cradle</strong>, slip through the shadowed halls of <strong>Orr-Sihm Castle</strong> and walk beneath the suffocating canopy of the <strong>Vardain Forest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions come and go - some stolen, some broken, some betraying you when the cost grows too steep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>Luvarith</strong>'s heart stands the <strong>Throne of Aether</strong>, a towering relic that refuses to die. It might hold the secrets of the four <strong>Keystones</strong> scattered across the land, bound by an empire long ago. But every fragment of truth carries a price, and some debts can only be paid in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a story about heroes. It\u2019s a story about survival, sacrifice, and the shadows that bind us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838460/extras/92f68685f1fb03bddf690df739a1b3c5.avif?t=1758869871\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Key Features:</u></i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2Deco Visual Style</strong> \u2013 Classic pixel characters set against modern 3D backdrops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Driven Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Everyone carries secrets and weight, shaping the fate of your party and the empire itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration of Forgotten Realms</strong> \u2013 Explore the Argentum Scholarium, brave the Desert Colossus Challenge and descend into the Underway Passage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Companions</strong> \u2013 Scoundrels, scholars, exiles, and ghosts bound by secrets and betrayal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Mysteries</strong> \u2013 Recover ancient lore and unlock the sealed gates of whatever dies beneath the earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgettable Music</strong> - Dive deep into the lore with majestic compositions and haunting melodies.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838460?t=1758869871","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838460/d43c60f67d42bc1e507d9b666b022a2001a07feb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758869871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838460/651c4ad98ec84b58ff53f8655ff9b83f2e0a728e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758869871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838460/651c4ad98ec84b58ff53f8655ff9b83f2e0a728e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758869871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luvarith</strong> rots on the edge of collapse. The forest whispers with hunger and the kingdom holds more secrets than it ever did kings. And beneath the ruins, something older still waits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2Deco role-playing game about scavengers, traitors, and survivors caught in a web of lies and forgotten history. Wander the blackened ruins of <strong>Vespera\u2019s Cradle</strong>, slip through the shadowed halls of <strong>Orr-Sihm Castle</strong> and walk beneath the suffocating canopy of the <strong>Vardain Forest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions come and go - some stolen, some broken, some betraying you when the cost grows too steep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>Luvarith</strong>'s heart stands the <strong>Throne of Aether</strong>, a towering relic that refuses to die. It might hold the secrets of the four <strong>Keystones</strong> scattered across the land, bound by an empire long ago. But every fragment of truth carries a price, and some debts can only be paid in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a story about heroes. It\u2019s a story about survival, sacrifice, and the shadows that bind us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838460/extras/92f68685f1fb03bddf690df739a1b3c5.avif?t=1758869871\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Key Features:</u></i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2Deco Visual Style</strong> \u2013 Classic pixel characters set against modern 3D backdrops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Driven Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Everyone carries secrets and weight, shaping the fate of your party and the empire itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration of Forgotten Realms</strong> \u2013 Explore the Argentum Scholarium, brave the Desert Colossus Challenge and descend into the Underway Passage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Companions</strong> \u2013 Scoundrels, scholars, exiles, and ghosts bound by secrets and betrayal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Mysteries</strong> \u2013 Recover ancient lore and unlock the sealed gates of whatever dies beneath the earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgettable Music</strong> - Dive deep into the lore with majestic compositions and haunting melodies.</p></li></ul>","developers":["ERMedia"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838460/6f65e355cd77403418a68df102ebf5f1d593f7f2/header.jpg?t=1758869871","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838460/392010429/448c1658f5ee844afa7c0d8f0b60e3cfc7aa9744/1757608070/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758119428","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838460/392010429/448c1658f5ee844afa7c0d8f0b60e3cfc7aa9744/1757608070/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758119428","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838460/392010429/448c1658f5ee844afa7c0d8f0b60e3cfc7aa9744/1757608070/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758119428","id":257194265,"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194265/ed7e97b2eeef44b934065a0280abfebdcf914312/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758119428"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838460/370838123/166c501579abf03cce28c2496ef6530bc5f00482/1757261966/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758119429","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838460/370838123/166c501579abf03cce28c2496ef6530bc5f00482/1757261966/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758119429","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838460/370838123/166c501579abf03cce28c2496ef6530bc5f00482/1757261966/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758119429","id":257194263,"name":"Opening Movie","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194263/ed7e97b2eeef44b934065a0280abfebdcf9